## Composite Types

### `types.postal_address`

Reusable postal address

**Owner:** `type_owner`

**Attribute:** `street` `text`; collation `pg_catalog."C"`

**Attribute:** `city` `text`; collation `pg_catalog."default"`; Postal locality

**Attribute:** `postal_code` `character varying(12)`; collation `pg_catalog."default"`

```sql
CREATE TYPE "types"."postal_address" AS (
    "street" text COLLATE pg_catalog."C",
    "city" text COLLATE pg_catalog."default",
    "postal_code" character varying(12) COLLATE pg_catalog."default"
);
```


